amta mi agagi ya inaro kayoy dios tan pinili to kayon kayaryan to
napnoy ispiritu santo ya inmebat si pedro sikayon manoley tan mamatakken na baley
iter kod sikay tombuk na panariay tawen say isebel mo diad dalin so nisebel met ed tawen say iyabuloy mo diad dalin so niabuloy met ed tawen
say panariay dios aliling toy bokel na mustasa a sankamelagan a bokel diad tapew na dalin
amayamay a judio so akabasad saya ta asingger ed siudad so pasen ya angipasakan ed kinen jesus tan nisulat ed salitan hebreo latin tan grigo
ta sankaabebaan ak ed saray apostol ag ak ingen manepeg a tawagey apostol ta pinapairap koy iglisia na dios
