imbagak ira yad sikayo pian niwala ed sikayo so liket ko tan nayadyari so liket yo
ibabaga to ni sikayo ran hintil manliket k ayo a kaiba yo ray pinilin totooy dios
gawa yoy anggaay nayarian yo a mikaarod amin a too tan mampasanto kayo ta no ag ya gawaen na siopaman ag to nanengneng so katawan
nilakseb to ingen so inkadios to tan inala toy kipapasen na aripen nen nagmaliw a too
