andi no ag ingen say dios so mangiiter ed siak na pakayarin mamaekal ed saray dimonyo sikato yay mam apaneknek a sinmabi lad sikayoy panariay dios
kanyan gagawaen koy anggaay nayarian ko a malinis lawas so konsinsiak ed arap na dios tan saray totoo
inararoy ama so anak tan impalima tod sikatoy amin a bengatla
